{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37587","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:42.883128+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"### Description\n\nSuppose I have a Python function that sometimes raising an exception, and I make ordered IO callbacks to that function.\n\nIf I run a jitted computation that does an ordered IO callback inside of a shard_map, and the callback raises some exception E, then I observe that all future ordered IO callbacks to any callback function will immediately fail, raising the same exception E instead of running.\n\nThat is:\n```python\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax.sharding import PartitionSpec as P\nimport numpy as np\n\njax.config.update(\"jax_num_cpu_devices\", 4)\njax.config.update('jax_traceback_filtering', 'off')\n\ndef add1(x):\n    print('hello')\n    x = np.array(x)\n    if (x == 5).any():\n        raise ValueError('No fives.')\n    return x + 1\n\n@jax.jit\ndef f(x):\n    return jax.experimental.io_callback(\n        add1,\n        x,\n        x,\n        ordered=True)\n\ndef run_f(x):\n    try:\n        print(f'f({x}):', f(x))\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f'exception while running f({x}):', e)\n\nsharded_f = jax.jit(jax.shard_map(f, in_specs=P('i'), out_specs=P('i')))\n\ndef run_sharded_f(x):\n    x = jax.reshard(x, P('i'))\n    try:\n        print(f'sharded_f({x}):', sharded_f(x))\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f'exception while running sharded_f({x}):', e)\n\nmesh = jax.make_mesh((4,), ('i',))\n\nrun_f(jnp.array(5))  # raises\n\nrun_f(jnp.array(6))  # succeeds\n\nwith jax.set_mesh(mesh):\n      run_sharded_f(jnp.array([3, 4, 5, 6]))  # raises\n\nwith jax.set_mesh(mesh):\n      run_sharded_f(jnp.array([1, 1, 1, 1]))  # raises `ValueError: No fives.` and does not print\n\nrun_f(jnp.array(7))  # raises `ValueError: No fives.` and does not print\n\ndef another_callback(x):\n  return\n\n@jax.jit\ndef g(x):\n  print('hello 2')\n  return jax.experimental.io_callback(another_callback, (), x, ordered=True)\n\ng(jnp.zeros((4, 3)))  # raises `ValueError: No fives.` and does not print\n```\n\n[colab repro](https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1YoqJPiJJxE9VGy5fFLBha90WgrgIEbhm?usp=sharing)\n\nIs this expected behavior?\n\n\n\n\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\njax:    0.10.0\njaxlib: 0.10.0\nnumpy:  2.0.2\npython: 3.12.13 (main, Mar  4 2026, 09:23:07) [GCC 11.4.0]\ndevice info: cpu-4, 4 local devices\"\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: uname_result(system='Linux', node='e2bb59a7faf4', release='6.6.122+', version='#1 SMP Thu Apr 30 18:17:14 UTC 2026', machine='x86_64')\n```","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37587/comments","created_at":"2026-05-12T17:08:11Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37587/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/37587","id":4431123781,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37587/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABCB2VRQ","number":37587,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37587/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","state":"open","state_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url